<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            color: #3266CC;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .success-badge {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        .info-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .info-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #666;
        }
        .info-value {
            color: #333;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #ffc107;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abittoenergy Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;" />
        </div>
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Gas Purchase Successful! ⛽</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
            
            <div style="text-align: center;">
                <span class="success-badge">✓ Payment Confirmed</span>
            </div>
            
            <p>Your gas purchase has been successfully processed! Your meter valve will be opened automatically to dispense the gas you purchased.</p>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Purchase Details:</strong></p>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Amount Paid:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">₦{{amountPaid}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Gas Quantity:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{kgPurchased}} kg</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Price per kg:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">₦{{gasPricePerKg}}/kg</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Transaction Reference:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{reference}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Date:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{purchaseDate}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Meter Information:</strong></p>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Meter Number:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{meterNumber}}</span>
                </div>
                {{#if estateName}}
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Location:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{{estateName}}{{#if houseNumber}}, House {{houseNumber}}{{/if}}</span>
                </div>
                {{/if}}
            </div>

            <div class="highlight">
                <p><strong>What happens next?</strong></p>
                <p>Our system has sent a command to your meter to open the valve and dispense <strong>{{kgPurchased}} kg</strong> of gas. The dispensing process will begin shortly and you'll be able to monitor the status in your dashboard.</p>
            </div>
            
            <p>You can view your purchase history and track the dispensing status by logging into your dashboard.</p>
            
            <p>If you experience any issues with the gas dispensing, please contact our support team immediately with your transaction reference: <strong>{{reference}}</strong></p>
            
            <p>Thank you for choosing Abittoenergy!</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Abittoenergy Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Abittoenergy. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
